{
  "about": "Shared test vectors for the cover and card picture crop (TierYourLife cover focus, 15.11.2026, second round included; _coordination/cover-focus-2026-11-15/SPEC.md). The Proxy checks its own cropOf against this file (functions/src/coverFocus.ts); Web and Android copy it into their tests unchanged and check their own crop against every case.",
  "formula": "For a picture width x height, a frame aspect (frame width / frame height) and a focus {x, y, zoom} (none = {0.5, 0.35, 1} when height/width > 1.2, a tall picture, else {0.5, 0.5, 1}): if width/height > aspect then cropHeight = height, cropWidth = height*aspect, else cropWidth = width, cropHeight = width/aspect; cropWidth /= zoom; cropHeight /= zoom; crop.x = clamp(x*width - cropWidth/2, 0, width - cropWidth); crop.y = clamp(y*height - cropHeight/2, 0, height - cropHeight). The crop is in the picture's own pixels and is scaled to fill the frame.",
  "tolerance": 1e-06,
  "defaults": {
    "about": "The focus a picture without one is shown with: tall (height/width strictly over 1.2) or not.",
    "tallRatio": 1.2,
    "tall": {
      "x": 0.5,
      "y": 0.35,
      "zoom": 1
    },
    "other": {
      "x": 0.5,
      "y": 0.5,
      "zoom": 1
    }
  },
